  "details": "VRChat Version: 2022.1.1 (1169)\nBug: The \"other\" notification tab is not working as of last update on 2/24/2022 1:42 PM, causing all notifications in the tab to be invisible or just not there, such as vote kicks and VRC+ Gift notifications.\nRecreation steps:\nOption 1:\nStep 1: send in a vote kick request through a separate user.\nStep 2: go into main user and access the \"other\" notification tab.\nOption 2:\nStep 1: send a VRC+ gift to the main user through a separate user.\nStep 2: go into main user and access the \"other\" notification tab.",
